{id:'mc-shrinkage', type:'mc', channel:'cov', channel_label:'Covariance & Portfolio Math',
 text:`In <code>predict_next.py:176-180</code>:
<pre class="snippet">Sigma_emp = ret_panel.cov().<span class="fn">to_numpy</span>()
diag      = np.diag(np.diag(Sigma_emp))
Sigma     = (<span class="num">1</span> - lam) * Sigma_emp + lam * diag   <span class="cm"># lam = shrink arg</span></pre>
What does <code>Sigma</code> equal when <code>lam = 1.0</code>?`,
